activity Request Return
activity Approve Return
activity Generate Return Label
activity Ship Item Back
activity Receive Item
activity Inspect Item
activity Determine Refund
activity Process Refund
activity Restock Item
activity Dispose Item
bind Request Return: Return ID, Return Reason, Return Status
bind Approve Return: Return Status
bind Generate Return Label: Return Status
bind Ship Item Back: Shipping Method, Shipping Cost, Days to Return, Return Status
bind Receive Item: Return Status
bind Inspect Item: Item Condition, Inspection Result, Return Status
bind Determine Refund: Refund Amount, Return Status
bind Process Refund: Return Status
bind Restock Item: Restock Quantity, Return Status
bind Dispose Item: Return Status
Return ID: integer between 1000 and 9999
Return Reason: Defective, Damaged, Wrong Item, No Longer Needed
Return Status: Requested, Approved, Received, Inspected, Refunded, Restocked, Disposed
Shipping Method: UPS, FedEx, USPS
Shipping Cost: float between 0.0 and 50.0
Days to Return: integer between 1 and 60
Item Condition: integer between 1 and 5
Inspection Result: Acceptable, Damaged, Unacceptable
Refund Amount: float between 0.0 and 1000.0
Restock Quantity: integer between 1 and 100
Init[Request Return] | |
Response[Request Return, Approve Return] | | |0,24,h
Precedence[Generate Return Label, Approve Return] | | |0,30,m
Chain Response[Approve Return, Generate Return Label] | | |0,30,m
Precedence[Ship Item Back, Approve Return] | | |1,14,d
Response[Ship Item Back, Receive Item] | | |
Precedence[Inspect Item, Receive Item] | | |0,48,h
Succession[Determine Refund, Process Refund] | | |0,2,d
Alternate Precedence[Restock Item, Inspect Item] |A.Inspection Result is Acceptable | |
Alternate Precedence[Dispose Item, Inspect Item] |A.Inspection Result in (Damaged, Unacceptable) | |
Exclusive Choice[Restock Item, Dispose Item] |A.Return Status is Inspected | |